          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hook qua CydiaSubstrate — ứng dụng đã có sẵn nó."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "通过 CydiaSubstrate 进行 hook——应用已包含它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hooks via CydiaSubstrate. The app doesn't include it, so VexSign adds ElleKit (a Substrate replacement) automatically when signing." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "يربط عبر CydiaSubstrate. التطبيق لا يتضمنه، لذا يضيف VexSign بديل ElleKit تلقائيًا عند التوقيع."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Háčkuje přes CydiaSubstrate. Aplikace ho neobsahuje, takže VexSign při podepisování automaticky přidá ElleKit (náhradu za Substrate)."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hookt über CydiaSubstrate. Die App enthält es nicht, daher fügt VexSign beim Signieren automatisch ElleKit (einen Substrate-Ersatz) hinzu."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Engancha mediante CydiaSubstrate. La app no lo incluye, así que VexSign añade ElleKit (un reemplazo de Substrate) automáticamente al firmar."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Accroche via CydiaSubstrate. L’app ne l’inclut pas, donc VexSign ajoute automatiquement ElleKit (un remplacement de Substrate) lors de la signature."
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mengaitkan melalui CydiaSubstrate. Aplikasi tidak menyertakannya, jadi VexSign menambahkan ElleKit (pengganti Substrate) secara otomatis saat menandatangani."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Si aggancia tramite CydiaSubstrate. L'app non lo include, quindi VexSign aggiunge automaticamente ElleKit (un sostituto di Substrate) durante la firma."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hakuje poprzez CydiaSubstrate. Aplikacja go nie zawiera, więc VexSign automatycznie dodaje ElleKit (zamiennik Substrate) podczas podpisywania."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Перехватывает через CydiaSubstrate. Приложение его не содержит, поэтому VexSign автоматически добавляет ElleKit (замену Substrate) при подписи."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "CydiaSubstrate üzerinden hook yapar. Uygulama bunu içermiyor, bu yüzden VexSign imzalarken otomatik olarak ElleKit (bir Substrate alternatifi) ekler."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hook qua CydiaSubstrate. Ứng dụng không có sẵn nó, nên VexSign tự động thêm ElleKit (bản thay thế Substrate) khi ký."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "通过 CydiaSubstrate 进行 hook。应用未包含它，因此 VexSign 会在签名时自动添加 ElleKit（一个 Substrate 替代品）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Icons and web data VexSign downloaded. Rebuilt as you browse." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "أيقونات وبيانات ويب نزّلها VexSign. يُعاد بناؤها أثناء التصفح."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ikony a webová data, která VexSign stáhl. Znovu se vytvoří při procházení."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Symbole und Webdaten, die VexSign geladen hat. Werden beim Blättern neu aufgebaut."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Icons and web data VexSign downloaded. Rebuilt as you browse."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Iconos y datos web que descargó VexSign. Se reconstruyen al navegar."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Icônes et données web téléchargées par VexSign. Reconstruites à la navigation."
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ikon dan data web yang diunduh VexSign. Dibangun ulang saat Anda menjelajah."
