    "Automatic uses a usable long-lived or enterprise certificate for direct signing. In the combined host, a missing, expired, revoked or short-profile certificate selects the container instead. Standalone builds retain their direct OTA/IDevice path for already signed IPAs. Explicit modes never silently fall back." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Automatic uses a usable long-lived or enterprise certificate for direct signing. In the combined host, a missing, expired, revoked or short-profile certificate selects the container instead. Standalone builds retain their direct OTA/IDevice path for already signed IPAs. Explicit modes never silently fall back."
          }
        }
      }
    },
